<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Summon Lightning</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Druid (guild level 60)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast summon lightning
tell elemental &lt;command&gt;
</pre>
<p>The caster chants 'Gea Thudas', their hair stands on end, and with a clap 
of thunder a lightning elemental (level 90) is summoned to serve them. It 
follows you and fights beside you, hurling jolts of lightning at your 
foes, and you can give it orders with tell: to attack (tell elemental 
kill orc), to walk, and the like. It won't attack another player unless 
both of you have signed the Book of Blood.
</p><p>It can stay on this plane only a short while: from half a minute to a 
minute or two, longer the better the casting. Then it is gone, dropping 
whatever it carried. If it is killed first, it is gone too.
</p><p>You must be standing. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
